<title>UK: BOE allots 155 mln stg in repos to July 28.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 155 mln stg in repos to July 28.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 155 million stg of 6.75 percent repos to July 28.</p>
<p>The Bank's initial liquidity forecast was for a shortage of 1.15 billion stg.</p>
</text>
